# $apply passes string-keyed dict entries as named args to the called function.
# When the called function is a Rust-native builtin (e.g. $builtin-add), it
# calls reject_named and produces E023 (NamedArgRejected).
# Note: $+ is a Tinct wrapper function, not the raw builtin.
[apply builtin-add [named: 1]]
=== error
[E023]

=== warn
cannot unify Fn@_ [_] with Fn@_t0 [_t0 _t0] at 4:8-4:19
